From bce197e896d8c496764b9dab2bc96f631632934a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LR Recomp <noreply@lr-recomp.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:38:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 093/108] gpu: per-frame command thread breakdown for slow
 frames (vulkan_slow_frame_ms)

Every frame whose time between swaps exceeds vulkan_slow_frame_ms (default 30)
logs "GPU slow frame" with the command thread's time in shader translation,
pipeline configuration, texture loads, render target updates, copies
(resolves), submits, fence waits and WAIT_REG_MEM waits (the base command
processor now always totals WAIT_REG_MEM time), plus the draw count.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

